          "passage_id": "24241932:abstract:460:685:6189e65c764c",
          "paper_id": "24241932",
          "section": "abstract",
          "text": "RESULTS Univariate analysis showed significant associations of tuberculosis rates for the whole population with several indices of deprivation (P<0.01) and with the proportion of the population of south Asian origin (P<0.01).",
          "score": 0.7262752056121826,
          "page": null,
          "sentence_indices": [],
          "source_version": null
        },
        {
          "passage_id": "24241932:abstract:103:296:2c4d3164d547",
          "paper_id": "24241932",
          "section": "abstract",
          "text": "DESIGN Retrospective ecological study comparing incidence of tuberculosis in white and south Asian residents of the 39 electoral wards in Birmingham with ethnic specific indices of deprivation.",
          "score": 0.7243962287902832,
          "page": null,
          "sentence_indices": [],
          "source_version": null
        },
        {
          "passage_id": "24241932:abstract:867:989:c1460a6faf30",
          "paper_id": "24241932",
          "section": "abstract",
          "text": "For the white population, overcrowding was associated with tuberculosis rates independently of other variables (P=0.0036).",
          "score": 0.7049278020858765,
          "page": null,
          "sentence_indices": [],
          "source_version": null
        },
        {
          "passage_id": "10365749:abstract:289:393:65c5521191b7",
          "paper_id": "10365749",
          "section": "abstract",
          "text": "OBJECTIVE To examine the spatial distribution of TB and its association with neighbourhood risk factors.",
          "score": 0.6649034023284912,
          "page": null,
          "sentence_indices": [],
          "source_version": null
        },
        {
          "passage_id": "10365749:abstract:0:113:fc648f55ce17",
          "paper_id": "10365749",
          "section": "abstract",
          "text": "BACKGROUND Tuberculosis (TB) has been reported to be associated with poverty, especially in developing countries.",
          "score": 0.6488114595413208,
          "page": null,
          "sentence_indices": [],
          "source_version": null
        },
        {
          "passage_id": "10365749:abstract:114:284:afc27b016289",
          "paper_id": "10365749",
          "section": "abstract",
          "text": "Hong Kong is one of the few industrialised areas with a high incidence of TB where previous reports on the effect of poverty at neighbourhood level have been conflicting.",
          "score": 0.6465549468994141,
          "page": null,
          "sentence_indices": [],
          "source_version": null
        },
        {
          "passage_id": "22414304:abstract:366:491:e5b1e46a4953",
          "paper_id": "22414304",
          "section": "abstract",
          "text": "Eight hundred and twenty-seven adult TB patients (451 men and 376 women) were registered between 1 July and 31 December 1995.",
          "score": 0.5508223176002502,
          "page": null,
          "sentence_indices": [],
          "source_version": null
        },
        {
          "passage_id": "22414304:abstract:216:365:a1a326703195",
          "paper_id": "22414304",
          "section": "abstract",
          "text": "A prospective study was carried out to determine treatment outcome in an unselected cohort of TB patients admitted to Zomba General Hospital, Malawi.",
          "score": 0.5270313024520874,
          "page": null,
          "sentence_indices": [],
          "source_version": null
        },
        {
          "passage_id": "5284188:abstract:1145:1258:ceb3cad1db12",
          "paper_id": "5284188",
          "section": "abstract",
          "text": "This study greatly contributes to the understanding of the burden of drug-resistant TB in urban areas of Belarus.",
          "score": 0.616804301738739,
          "page": null,
          "sentence_indices": [],
          "source_version": null
        },
        {
          "passage_id": "5284188:abstract:1014:1144:0cd9ed828a0f",
          "paper_id": "5284188",
          "section": "abstract",
          "text": "The findings of this survey in Minsk city are alarming and represent the highest proportions of MDR-TB ever recorded in the world.",
          "score": 0.6101904511451721,
          "page": null,
          "sentence_indices": [],
          "source_version": null
        },
        {
          "passage_id": "5284188:abstract:898:1013:cc9da488da83",
          "paper_id": "5284188",
          "section": "abstract",
          "text": "Patients <35 yrs of age have shown a two times higher odds ratio of multidrug-resistant TB than those aged >35 yrs.",
          "score": 0.5202152132987976,
          "page": null,
          "sentence_indices": [],
          "source_version": null
        },
        {
